    "title": "West Haven recoups hundreds of thousands through vehicle registration crackdown - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago WEST HAVEN, Conn. — The City of West Haven says a new enforcement effort targeting out-of-city and out-of-state vehicle registrations is already paying off in a big way. After about a year of preparation, the city launched its Motor Vehicle Compliance Program, and officials say it has already recovered more than $300,000 in revenue from people who were not properly registering their vehicles and paying local taxes. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
